{"suttaId":"pv16","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[558,614],"vripara":"168"},"segments":{"pv16:0.3":"Nandāpetivatthu","pv16:1.1":"“Kāḷī dubbaṇṇarūpāsi, pharusā bhīrudassanā;","pv16:1.3":"Piṅgalāsi kaḷārāsi, na taṃ maññāmi mānusin”ti.","pv16:2.1":"“Ahaṃ nandā nandisena, bhariyā te pure ahuṃ;","pv16:2.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","pv16:3.1":"“Kiṃ nu kāyena vācāya, manasā dukkaṭaṃ kataṃ;","pv16:3.3":"Kissa kammavipākena, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","pv16:4.1":"“Caṇḍī ca pharusā cāsiṃ [caṇḍī pharusavācā ca (sī.)], tayi cāpi agāravā;","pv16:4.3":"Tāhaṃ duruttaṃ vatvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","pv16:5.1":"“Handuttarīyaṃ dadāmi te, imaṃ [idaṃ (sī. aṭṭha.)] dussaṃ nivāsaya;","pv16:5.3":"Imaṃ dussaṃ nivāsetvā, ehi nessāmi taṃ gharaṃ.","pv16:6.1":"“Vatthañca annapānañca, lacchasi tvaṃ gharaṃ gatā;","pv16:6.3":"Putte ca te passissasi, suṇisāyo ca dakkhasī”ti.","pv16:7.1":"“Hatthena hatthe te dinnaṃ, na mayhaṃ upakappati;","pv16:7.3":"Bhikkhū ca sīlasampanne, vītarāge bahussute.","pv16:8.1":"“Tappehi annapānena, mama dakkhiṇamādisa;","pv16:8.3":"Tadāhaṃ sukhitā hessaṃ, sabbakāmasamiddhinī”ti.","pv16:9.1":"Sādhūti so paṭissutvā, dānaṃ vipulamākiri;","pv16:9.3":"Annaṃ pānaṃ khādanīyaṃ, vatthasenāsanāni ca;","pv16:9.5":"Chattaṃ gandhañca mālañca, vividhā ca upāhanā.","pv16:10.1":"Bhikkhū ca sīlasampanne, vītarāge bahussute;","pv16:10.3":"Tappetvā annapānena, tassā dakkhiṇamādisī.","pv16:11.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, vipāko udapajjatha;","pv16:11.3":"Bhojanacchādanapānīyaṃ, dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","pv16:12.1":"Tato suddhā sucivasanā, kāsikuttamadhārinī;","pv16:12.3":"Vicittavatthābharaṇā, sāmikaṃ upasaṅkami.","pv16:13.1":"“Abhikkantena vaṇṇena, yā tvaṃ tiṭṭhasi devate;","pv16:13.3":"Obhāsentī disā sabbā, osadhī viya tārakā.","pv16:14.1":"“Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo, kena te idha mijjhati;","pv16:14.3":"Uppajjanti ca te bhogā, ye keci manaso piyā.","pv16:15.1":"“Pucchāmi taṃ devi mahānubhāve, manussabhūtā kimakāsi puññaṃ;","pv16:15.3":"Kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā, vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","pv16:16.1":"“Ahaṃ nandā nandisena, bhariyā te pure ahuṃ;","pv16:16.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā.","pv16:17.1":"“Tava dinnena dānena, modāmi akutobhayā;","pv16:17.3":"Ciraṃ jīva gahapati, saha sabbehi ñātibhi;","pv16:17.5":"Asokaṃ virajaṃ khemaṃ, āvāsaṃ vasavattinaṃ.","pv16:18.1":"“Idha dhammaṃ caritvāna, dānaṃ datvā gahapati;","pv16:18.3":"Vineyya maccheramalaṃ samūlaṃ, anindito saggamupehi ṭhānan”ti.","pv16:19.1":"Nandāpetivatthu catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":814,"to":874,"paras":[{"para":814,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv16:1"],"words":["kāḷī","pharusā","bhīrudassanā","piṅgalā","kaḷārā","na taṃ maññāmi mānusiṃ"],"lines":["Gāthāya ajjhabhāsi.","Tattha <b>kāḷī</b>ti kāḷavaṇṇā, jhāmaṅgārasadiso hissā vaṇṇo ahosi.","<b>Pharusā</b>ti kharagattā.","<b>Bhīrudassanā</b>ti bhayānakadassanā sappaṭibhayākārā.","“Bhārudassanā”ti vā pāṭho, bhāriyadassanā, dubbaṇṇatādinā duddasikāti attho.","<b>Piṅgalā</b>ti piṅgalalocanā.","<b>Kaḷārā</b>ti kaḷāradantā.","<b>Na taṃ maññāmi mānusin</b>ti ahaṃ taṃ mānusinti na maññāmi, petimeva ca taṃ maññāmīti adhippāyo.","Taṃ sutvā petī attānaṃ pakāsentī –"],"lineRefs":[["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"],["pv16:1"]]},{"para":816,"vripara":"169","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Ahaṃ nandā nandisena, bhariyā te pure ahuṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":817,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":818,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv16:2"],"words":["ahaṃ nandā nandisenā","bhariyā te pure ahuṃ"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>ahaṃ nandā nandisenā</b>ti sāmi nandisena ahaṃ nandā nāma.","<b>Bhariyā te pure ahun</b>ti purimajātiyaṃ tuyhaṃ bhariyā ahosiṃ.","Ito paraṃ –"],"lineRefs":[["pv16:2"],["pv16:2"],["pv16:2"],["pv16:2"]]},{"para":820,"vripara":"170",